# Feature 1: Dimensions → Map

Current focus. Spec: docs/features/01-dimensions-to-map.md

## Scope

- Room W × L × H → 2D floor plan + 3D shell
- Doors and windows on walls
- Editable dimension labels
- Multiple named rooms
- 2D/3D toggle, pan, zoom

## Out of scope

- Furniture blocks (Feature 2)
- Fit/clearance checks (Feature 3)
- AI recommendations (Feature 5)
- Floor plan upload (v1.1)

## MVP build order

1.1 Single room → 1.2 Edit dimensions → 1.3 Doors → 1.4 Windows → 1.5 Multi-room → 1.6 3D view → 1.7 Pan/zoom

## Data model

- `Home` → `Room[]` → `Wall[]`, `Opening[]`
- Rectangular rooms only in MVP
- Units: cm default

## UI principles

- Numeric input over freehand drawing
- Dimension labels always visible in 2D
- Minimal styling — accurate, not pretty
